  "notes": "preface_padding (setting 12) carries ignored bytes ff c0 ff that are not a valid varint62, and every setting keeps its default; settings_len counts the padding TLV, so re-encoding the parsed preface without padding does not reproduce these bytes (WIRE_EXAMPLES 1.28)"
}
